<!-- ==========================================================================
  Uber Property Investments — src/pages/index.astro
  ==========================================================================
  THE WHOLE SITE IS THIS ONE FILE. It is a single self-contained Astro page:
  raw HTML + one <style> block (custom steel/brick/amber/paper design
  system) + one <script> block (FAQ accordion, lead-form submit). It does
  NOT use the starter Layout/components, Tailwind, or React — those were
  removed in the rewrite (see docs/architecture.md).

  HOW THE LEAD FORM WORKS (read docs/lead-capture.md for the full story):
  The form is a Netlify Form (data-netlify="true", name "cash-offer").
  Submissions land in the Netlify dashboard (Forms) AND trigger an email
  notification — but ONLY after a human does two dashboard steps:
    1. Site configuration -> Forms -> turn OFF "Ignore HTML forms"
       (the site shipped with ignore_html_forms=true, which makes Netlify
       ignore the form entirely).
    2. Site configuration -> Forms -> Form notifications -> email to
       gage.e.kirton@gmail.com (personal Gmail; the old business inbox
       offers@uberpropertyinvestments.com LAPSED).
  The form previously only console.log'd the lead and showed a confirmation
  — leads went nowhere. That is why the 2026-11-10 test lead never arrived.

  HONEST-COPY RULES: claims marked TODO in this file are UNVERIFIED. Do not
  "fix" them by inventing numbers, names, or backstories. The owner must
  verify or correct each one — the full list is in docs/content-notes.md.
  Never put a fake phone number, email, testimonial, or statistic on this
  page. Never submit the live form to "test" it.
  ========================================================================== -->
